\f1\fs24 \AppleTypeServices \cf6 \cb3 Skills you will learn\cb1 \

\f2 \cf7 \cb8 Container Orchestration: Managed Kubernetes
\f1\fs32 \cf9 \cb1 \
\pard\pardeftab720\sa320\partightenfactor0
\cf10 \cb3 This lab walks you through spinning up a fully functional 
\f3\b Amazon EKS
\f1\b0  cluster using the eksctl command-line tool. By the end, you\'92ll have a running Kubernetes cluster on AWS\'97complete with worker nodes\'97so you can start deploying apps, attaching volumes, and exploring everything EKS has to offer. 
\f4\i Cue the confetti!
\f1\i0 \cb1 \

\fs48 \cf2 \cb3 Prerequisites\cb1 \
\pard\tx220\tx720\pardeftab720\li720\fi-720\partightenfactor0
